#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:1
#: 31c19aa56138465db22bce58b723727a
msgid "自定义数据集"
msgstr "Custom datasets"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:3
#: 5084b6803fcd452593719a23814ce93b
msgid "UniKT 采用标准化、强类型的数据管线，将来自不同平台的原始答题日志，统一转换成标准化 Parquet 序列与特征关系表。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT adopts a standardized, strongly typed data pipeline that transforms"
" raw interaction logs from heterogeneous platforms into standardized "
"Parquet sequences and feature relation tables."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:5
#: 44cf602f6c134d7ebae4acce08e75ccc
msgid ""
"通过继承 `DataSource` 并实现数据提取、转换与加载规范，开发者可以轻松将专有或公开数据集接入到 UniKT "
"生态中。基类通过标准模板方法驱动整个处理流水线："
msgstr ""
"By inheriting from `DataSource` and implementing ETL specifications, "
"developers can easily integrate proprietary or public datasets into the "
"UniKT ecosystem. The base class drives the pipeline via template methods:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:7
#: 3ee83ecf6e8847f4bc41f03b86e2d755
msgid "**`load_src_data()`**：读取 CSV、TSV 或 JSON 等格式的原始交互文件。"
msgstr ""
"**`load_src_data()`**: Reads raw interaction files in CSV, TSV, or JSON "
"formats."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:8
#: 7b1ab2cdef904cc9a889736ea0755a8c
msgid "**`clean_raw_data()`**：重命名列并过滤缺省值或非法交互。"
msgstr ""
"**`clean_raw_data()`**: Renames columns and filters out missing values or"
" invalid interactions."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:9
#: 9dbc2143902143a4816df548dacfd965
msgid "**`transform_data()`**：重新映射紧凑 ID，提取技能列表，调用 `set_sequence_data()` 注册主表。"
msgstr ""
"**`transform_data()`**: Remaps IDs to contiguous compact integers, "
"extracts skill lists, and invokes `set_sequence_data()` to register the "
"master sequence table."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:10
#: 7a1ec08a3c694e9a81e940a82bfdda6a
msgid "**划分与序列切分**：基类自动处理样本分层抽样、K 折标签注入，并分别生成题目级与技能级时序切片。"
msgstr ""
"**Splitting and Sequence Slicing**: The base class automatically handles "
"stratified sampling, K-fold label injection, and generates question-level"
" and skill-level sequence slices."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:11
#: c66fc56d7c20467b8d21370f672d7fd2
msgid "**持久化落盘**：将规范化序列写入 Parquet 并自动生成 `metadata.json`。"
msgstr ""
"**Persistence to Disk**: Serializes normalized sequences to Parquet and "
"automatically generates `metadata.json`."

