msgid "`DataSource` 内部封装了强大的切分流水线，子类**无需重复实现切分与持久化逻辑**，只需在 CLI 中驱动或直接调用基类内置方法："
msgstr ""
"`DataSource` encapsulates a robust slicing pipeline internally; "
"subclasses **do not need to reimplement slicing or persistence**, and can"
" simply invoke base class methods via CLI:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:175
#: 4e61dc41984e4815973ca036213ccb5c
msgid "**`add_kfold_labels(n_splits=5, test_ratio=0.2)`**："
msgstr "**`add_kfold_labels(n_splits=5, test_ratio=0.2)`**: "

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:176
#: 3b0e7499faa448c1b3a61d6621bf3319
msgid "划分学生维度的训练折与留出测试集（按学生划分，杜绝跨折学生信息泄露）。"
msgstr ""
"Partitions student-level training folds and held-out test sets "
"(preventing cross-fold student data leakage)."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:177
#: 951b6844a3fe47b39f88054eb889686a
msgid "**`build_split_question_sequence_data()`**："
msgstr "**`build_split_question_sequence_data()`**: "

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:178
#: 67fcdca4d9234d4a9406794b91dfec46
msgid "将长交互切分成适合模型处理的固定最大长度序列，并记录题目级切分元信息。"
msgstr ""
"Slices long interactions into sequences matching maximum length budgets "
"and records question-level slicing metadata."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:179
#: dd22296b8abd410e818e6bd07a448d22
msgid "**`build_split_skill_sequence_data()`**："
msgstr "**`build_split_skill_sequence_data()`**: "

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:180
#: 230ae44247da4256963c9878b92801df
msgid "当一道题目关联多个知识点时，展开知识点序列并对齐时间步切分。"
msgstr ""
"When a question maps to multiple skills, expands skill sequences and "
"aligns temporal step slicing."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:181
#: 12361238cd8c4b37a9017f11366e8146
msgid "**`save_data()` 与 `save_metadata()`**："
msgstr "**`save_data()` and `save_metadata()`**:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:182
#: 4de49dc6200b45c189bf008b6b6e8f59
msgid ""
"自动将切分后的序列保存为高效的 Apache Parquet 格式，并将题目总数、知识点总数、序列最大长度、切分哈希值等元数据保存为 "
"`metadata.json`。"
msgstr ""
"Automatically serializes sliced sequences into efficient Apache Parquet "
"format and saves summary metadata (counts of questions, skills, max "
"sequence lengths, and split hashes) to `metadata.json`."

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:186
#: 164d1259ecc242f887e620a79ba6463e
msgid "命令行执行与验证"
msgstr "CLI Execution and Verification"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:188
#: c132798eb2ca4b72bd45425bf68d3d0f
msgid "通过 UniKT 的通用数据处理入口 `data_process.py` 执行流水线："
msgstr ""
"Execute the pipeline using UniKT's unified data processing entry point "
"`data_process.py`:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:190
#: 7322c821278c42169d58326d949c1f7e
msgid "1. 下载原始数据"
msgstr "1\\. Download Raw Data"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:191
#: d75b139d7cff4b2fbbee09e2b317cfbe
msgid "python data_process.py download -d my_dataset\n"
msgstr "python data_process.py download -d my_dataset\n"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:195
#: 9c7916909736460c8a3c9198c3816657
msgid "2. 执行 ETL 转换与 5 折序列生成"
msgstr "2\\. Run ETL Transformation and 5-Fold Sequence Generation"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:196
#: 45986fb4633a43dbaee6a1f7fe0149a1
msgid ""
"python data_process.py process -d my_dataset --data.kfold 5 "
"--data.max_seq_len 200\n"
msgstr ""
"python data_process.py process -d my_dataset --data.kfold 5 "
"--data.max_seq_len 200\n"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:200
#: 6357e47e49af410cae908db89dd111e4
msgid "如果模型需要评测窗口测试指标，可追加 `--extra windowlate`："
msgstr ""
"If evaluating windowed test metrics is required, append `--extra "
"windowlate`:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:201
#: 70933b66711049f1821a1db5e1dd02bc
msgid "python data_process.py process -d my_dataset --extra windowlate\n"
msgstr "python data_process.py process -d my_dataset --extra windowlate\n"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:205
#: 4cfc18cc510141c9a0f9bc0a2a0a05b1
msgid "3. 查看输出目录"
msgstr "3\\. Inspect Output Directory"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:206
#: 610eedbf3b15404295fcc23a6f713f1d
msgid "处理完成后，`data/my_dataset/` 目录结构如下："
msgstr ""
"After processing, the directory structure in `data/my_dataset/` is "
"organized as follows:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:207
#: 886d69f7d1b149fa80673ee94806c43f
msgid ""
"data/my_dataset/\n"
"├── raw/\n"
"│   └── interactions.csv\n"
"├── metadata.json                                      # 包含 num_users, "
"num_questions, num_skills 等统计\n"
"├── my_dataset_sequence.parquet                        # 清洗后的学生完整时序交互表\n"
"├── my_dataset_split_question_sequence.parquet         # 题目级切分序列\n"
"├── my_dataset_split_skill_sequence.parquet            # 知识点级切分序列\n"
"└── my_dataset_windowlate.parquet                      # 窗口测试评估序列 (若指定 "
"--extra windowlate)\n"
msgstr ""
"data/my_dataset/\n"
"├── raw/\n"
"│   └── interactions.csv\n"
"├── metadata.json                                      # Global metadata "
"snapshot\n"
"├── my_dataset_sequence.parquet                        # Cleaned complete"
" interaction table\n"
"├── my_dataset_split_question_sequence.parquet         # Question-level "
"sliced sequence table\n"
"├── my_dataset_split_skill_sequence.parquet            # Skill-level "
"sliced sequence table\n"
"└── my_dataset_relation_question_skill.parquet         # Question-skill "
"bipartite graph table\n"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:218
#: 2eb329083f98460a8bd7564be00385ae
msgid "4. 驱动模型训练"
msgstr "4\\. Launch Model Training"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:219
#: cd1445cd7841449690435267ae611327
msgid "数据生成后，任何已注册的模型均可无缝使用该数据集："
msgstr ""
"Once data is generated, any registered model can seamlessly train on the "
"dataset:"

#: ../../source/developer-guides/customize-dataset.md:220
#: 3b690622678f471c9707e668890ba5f1
msgid "python train.py -m GIKT -d my_dataset --data.fold 0\n"
msgstr "python train.py -m GIKT -d my_dataset --data.fold 0\n"
